


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_221055ea:


    "胡乱脱在地上的毛衣、衬衫之间，赤裸的两人肌肤相亲。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_0bd30edf:


    "回来没一会儿的屋内还不够暖和，甚至有点冷。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_7bf3c6cb:


    "但两人已经等不及让空调吹暖室内了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_9cf8c372:



    voice "d/2HI_0189"
    hina "「冷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_999613f0:



    voice "d/2FU_0157"
    fumi "「嗯，但是和阳菜贴在一起就没事……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_af54d6dd:


    "在几乎裸身后，两人体形上的差别一目了然。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_fb9b0eff:


    "阳菜柔细的肢体毫无赘肉，而与此相对，文的身体则是充满母性的丰满。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_741f139a:


    "截然不同的两人，有着各自独属的魅力。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_4b42e878:


    "阳菜贴过脸来，两人再次相吻。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d5af8833:


    "这次直接将舌与舌交缠到一起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_f461c899:


    hina_fumi "「啾……嗯嗯……嗯……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_5cfdf2e8:


    "粘稠的声音不断传出，二人混在一起的唾液从嘴角滑向下颌。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_da64a070:


    "阳菜在喘息之间疯狂地索求，而文也回应着她。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_37b8b510:


    "对初尝禁果不久的二人来说，仅是疯狂的亲吻似乎就足以变得很火热了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_a14c4b6b:



    voice "d/2HI_0191"
    hina "「噗哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_522c62d4:


    "阳菜为了呼吸从长长的吻中挪开了头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3a84f5a3:



    voice "d/2FU_0159"
    fumi "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_bf30fa43:


    "跟着文也是。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3698e9ab:



    voice "d/2HI_0192"
    hina "「有点难受吗？对、对不起……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d5cc6ff2:



    voice "d/2FU_0160"
    fumi "「没、没事……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_c3cea40d:


    "两人激烈地喘息着，连在唇之间的银线慢慢地变细，然后断开。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_1f54e461:



    voice "d/2FU_0161"
    fumi "「我们嘴周围都湿湿的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_8efecdf7:



    voice "d/2HI_0193"
    hina "「真的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_6e99ff90:


    "舔了舔嘴唇上的残留，就好像是吸吮到蜂蜜或奶油一般的甜美。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3a266094:


    "文充满爱意的看着阳菜像平常一样的反应。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_7ac4d3c9:



    voice "d/2HI_0194"
    hina "「呼……可以继续吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_db9ab9c2:


    "深呼吸一次后，阳菜询问道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3ca22b09:



    voice "d/2FU_0162"
    fumi "「嗯，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_2ba23691:


    "阳菜不断轻吮起文的脸颊。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d2449c87:



    voice "d/2HI_0195"
    hina "「小文的脸蛋滑滑的好舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_57cfa5a7:



    voice "d/2FU_0163"
    fumi "「阳菜的嘴唇也很柔软呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_1157882c:


    "阳菜的亲吻从文的脸颊移动到下颌，再一直慢慢滑到脖颈。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_e6e7b45d:



    voice "d/2FU_0164"
    fumi "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_c7405e67:


    "阳菜轻轻啃吸住文的脖颈。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_be033fad:


    "明明是很香艳的画面，却不知为何并未让人觉得淫靡。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_1e416b10:



    voice "d/2HI_0196"
    hina "「啊……总这样吸会留下草莓的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_cba89a4f:


    "阳菜忽地松口问道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_bee5f2aa:


    "阳菜不再吸食，文才放松下来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_4acb67c8:



    voice "d/2FU_0165"
    fumi "「是啊，脖子这里或许会很显眼」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_20958c9b:



    voice "d/2HI_0197"
    hina "「嗯，但是好羡慕你皮肤白白的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_b778a9c9:



    voice "d/2FU_0166"
    fumi "「有吗？我还有雀斑呢，如果不注意防晒很容易就起红呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_05ddeab4:



    voice "d/2HI_0198"
    hina "「啊～我从来没在意过防晒问题」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_27c018f9:


    "……稍微在意些吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_cb682bce:



    voice "d/2FU_0167RE"
    fumi "「鹰冈同学才是很白的吧？白皙细腻的感觉！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_151f8ffa:



    voice "d/2HI_0199"
    hina "「确实，像雪做的似的。但是——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_65cfc095:



    voice "d/2HI_0200"
    hina "「我喜欢小文的肤色」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_b0cf9c36:



    voice "d/2FU_0168"
    fumi "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_94b446fd:


    "阳菜的吐息在耳边轻挠，不禁引得文轻颤。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_6ebc5907:



    voice "d/2HI_0201"
    hina "「嗯……啾咯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_bdf869b2:


    "阳菜伸出舌头舔上文的耳垂。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d611ee98:



    voice "d/2FU_0169"
    fumi "「嗯……啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_92fc8039:


    "舌尖像在舔舐杯口一般，在耳朵边缘移动。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_a988fb50:



    voice "d/2HI_0202"
    hina "「……嗯，啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_c5069c81:


    "舌尖舔过一周后再次轻巧地滑入耳内。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_17c07226:



    voice "d/2FU_0170"
    fumi "「呀啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_cd97aa7d:


    "文没忍住突然的刺激，叫出了声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3673b9e5:



    voice "d/2HI_0203"
    hina "「哇？弄痛你了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_8419a965:


    "文的叫声甚至惊到了阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_423da2d1:



    voice "d/2FU_0171"
    fumi "「倒、倒不痛……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_12b5b9ac:



    voice "d/2HI_0204"
    hina "「……是不是吓到你了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_fbbe6666:



    voice "d/2FU_0172"
    fumi "「那个……稍微有点吓到」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_45422bfc:



    voice "d/2HI_0205"
    hina "「不太喜欢伸到耳朵里吗？那我不弄这里了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_ce68b743:



    voice "d/2FU_0173"
    fumi "「是有点敏感，最好能别太激烈……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d9937b96:


    "阳菜马上点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_efe6863f:



    voice "d/2HI_0206"
    hina "「……小文？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_779c7888:



    voice "d/2FU_0174"
    fumi "「在……在」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_ac6d66b4:



    voice "d/2HI_0207"
    hina "「要是有任何你想让我做的要说喔？啊，还有不想我对你做的也要」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_a379d94d:



    voice "d/2FU_0175"
    fumi "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_f82794d6:


    "就算这么说，文也不可能说得出什么具体的请求。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_c35b5323:


    "这方面的知识缺乏，同时还有羞耻心在作祟。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3a7d5d9d:



    voice "d/2FU_0176"
    fumi "「那个……就这么紧紧贴在一起已经很幸福了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_ae877c82:



    voice "d/2HI_0208"
    hina "「呵呵，我也是，感觉好舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_388b9d10:


    "羞涩的一笑。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_e53a2596:



    voice "d/2HI_0209"
    hina "「但是我想让你心跳不已，我想让小文感受到女人的快感」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_0509c7f3:


    "阳菜理解的『女人』一定也只是很模糊的概念，肯定连『快感』也不是真的很清楚。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_ff0ed8d3:


    "但就算是这样，为了文这个想法所产生的动力起码是真实的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_932689b5:



    voice "d/2FU_0177"
    fumi "「嗯……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_55f3f69c:


    "阳菜突然托起了文的酥胸。文对此稍微露出了惊讶的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_4585d9f6:


    "她总是突然做出一些什么来呢。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_366957b1:


    "从胸罩的拘束中解脱出来的乳房不再挺立，高耸的酥胸在重力下柔软地敞开垂落下来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_07c7639d:



    voice "d/2HI_0210"
    hina "「每次摸小文的胸部，心脏都跳得好快……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_3467a66d:


    "让人情不自禁地想揉捏这个软软塌垂下来的乳房。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_597b78a0:


    "大到阳菜无法单手握住，柔软到从指缝间挤出来的肉肉看着都要滴落下来似的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_cf683a07:



    voice "d/2FU_0178"
    fumi "「哈……嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_83906504:



    voice "d/2HI_0211"
    hina "「痛吗？会不会太用力了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_fff91cca:


    "文摇摇头，胸部又不会被捏漏了气。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_325b605b:



    voice "d/2HI_0212"
    hina "「是吗，太好了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_8ba35040:


    "和刚刚的吻有所不同，尽量控制住了凶猛，虽说不上很有技巧但却很温柔地揉捏。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_f508fcb6:


    "……换个说法的话，可能有点太谨慎。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_cfb99944:


    "在两人关系的不断亲近下，已经从最开始的完全凭冲动做，进入了开始考虑如何取悦对方的阶段，但或许反而是这样的念想导致动作变得很放不开。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_11c87f8f:



    voice "d/2HI_0213"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_77e3e6fb:


    "阳菜的舌头差不多要接近到尖顶。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_7e021dbd:



    voice "d/2FU_0179"
    fumi "「啊……嗯嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_7f72551c:


    "舌尖触碰到尖点，文不禁喊出声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_014a67bd:


    "比刚才的声音要更魅人，果然到了敏感点，比起痒痒更多的还是快感。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_324aed66:



    voice "d/2HI_0214"
    hina "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_04bb7817:


    "阳菜从声音的变化明白了这里是重点。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_95a03915:


    "再次贴过脸，探出舌头蹭到先端。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_50ebcac3:



    voice "d/2FU_0180"
    fumi "「啊，啊嗯……嗯嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_74522d1d:


    "含住乳头后，声音提的更高了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_8bae4850:



    voice "d/2HI_0215"
    hina "「变硬了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_62c9cf34:



    voice "d/2FU_0181"
    fumi "「……好害羞……啊……嗯嗯……呀啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_35720cca:


    "抵抗的话瞬间淹没在下一轮快感中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_f4542aa7:


    "阳菜变得认真起来，对含在嘴里的乳头发起攻击，打转、吮吸，不断做出各种尝试。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_ade6c9a4:



    voice "d/2HI_0216"
    hina "「……舒服吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_8483fd9b:


    "阳菜在做的时候不断瞟着文的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_da1c841d:



    voice "d/2FU_0182"
    fumi "「稍微，有点感觉了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_bf45a597:



    voice "d/2HI_0217"
    hina "「我继续努力！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_dc08551d:



    voice "d/2FU_0183"
    fumi "「嗯、是……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_da2bd9b6:


    "充满自信和决心的口气。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_bf0578f3:


    "没事吧？会不会努力过头太不放松了？"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d6be0d19:


    "左手爱抚着酥胸，不经意间右手也伸到文的肚脐眼上滑扫起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_31586e5f:



    voice "d/2FU_0184"
    fumi "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_d65bd3fb:


    "阳菜没察觉到文在忍耐着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_872d1fd2:



    voice "d/2HI_0218"
    hina "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_fc335a10:


    "阳菜稍微向下看了眼位置后，再次伸出手去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_65045fbd:



    voice "d/2FU_0185"
    fumi "「呜、啊……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_5c55df58:


    "阳菜的指尖沿着文敏感的腰线从侧腹划到她的大腿根处。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_1b87bad4:


    "但阳菜的手却又停在那里徘徊不定。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_27ade14c:



    voice "d/2HI_0219"
    hina "「嗯，能稍微打开点腿吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_7f158723:



    voice "d/2FU_0186"
    fumi "「好的……不过，现在也没法打很开」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_5de5823f:


    "内衣都没全褪下来，长筒袜也才脱到膝盖处，内裤褪到大腿根就没再管了。已经很难再打开更大了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_fd7589cd:



    voice "d/2HI_0220"
    hina "「啊，对……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_ccda91fb:


    "阳菜将手探进狭窄的大腿缝里。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_befd2d9e:



    voice "d/2FU_0187"
    fumi "「那、那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_4b70b194:


    "能明白文想说什么，为什么不脱掉内裤呢。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_9ae50713:



    voice "d/2FU_0188"
    fumi "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_27b61210:


    "阳菜的手在大腿间动来动去的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_6716cc80:


    "在大腿里侧窜来窜去，完全没碰到想去的位置上。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_c892b8c2:



    voice "d/2FU_0189"
    fumi "「哈……嗯……唔」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_f6a1422c:


    "文的膝盖夹住了阳菜的手腕和膝盖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_180f5da1:


    "但是阳菜却尝试打开阻碍。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_71b8a369:



    voice "d/2HI_0221"
    hina "「是这里吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_32da8400:



    voice "d/2FU_0190"
    fumi "「哎、啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_6f37e240:


    "指尖很微妙的并没能进去，而是碰到了外围。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_eb5a90a1:



    voice "d/2FU_0191"
    fumi "「嘿……呼……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_adfe28d6:


    "文咬紧下唇，像是在努力忍着什么。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_e74c1fe5:


    "当然阳菜也感觉到了她的反应。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_4e39c9fc:


    "感觉到把对方弄舒服了（？）的阳菜快速颤动起能自由活动的指尖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_80890b18:



    voice "d/2HI_0222"
    hina "「小文——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_23fff117:


    "文的身体颤动起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_b80ea4bf:



    voice "d/2FU_0192"
    fumi "「啊哈哈哈哈！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_e0613ac3:


    "顶开大腿间的阳菜的手，文决堤一般笑了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_be53b232:



    voice "d/2HI_0223"
    hina "「唉？唉？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_b8b2de09:



    voice "d/2FU_0193"
    fumi "「对、对不起……啊哈哈！哈哈哈哈！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_f9e907a3:


    "完全傻住的阳菜和还在笑的文。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_b6b57c86:



    voice "d/2FU_0194"
    fumi "「啊哈、啊哈哈哈！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene01_86464096:



